OL,3,AWill I get the #100 energy payment and
OL,4,Awhen will I receive it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 20 million households in England
OL,7,Fwill get a #100 payment to help with
OL,8,Ftheir energy bills this winter,
OL,9,FChancellor John Healey has announced in
OL,10,Fhis Budget.
OL,12,FHere's what you need to know about the
OL,13,Fpayment.
OL,15,FFor many people, the #100 on offer is a
OL,16,Flot of money, but it's worth
OL,17,Fconsidering the context.
OL,19,FA typical yearly energy bill is
OL,20,Fforecast to jump by #276 in January,
OL,21,Faccording to consultants Cornwall
OL,22,FInsight.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
